#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0888 expect=noViolation domain=ADPPK
#note "Positive control for the subclass gate: same popPK signature as the invalid twin, but DV is present. expect=noViolation asserts the rule EXECUTED and did not fire -- it fails if the subclass gate skips the rule."
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when DV is not present in an ADPPKIG v1.0 dataset.
dataset ADPPK
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL    type=Num
col EVID    type=Num
col MDV     type=Num
col AMT     type=Num
col CMT     type=Num
col DV      type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | CONC | 12.5 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 1 | 1
---
